data: {"id": "2c27d6e83b2046df-thinking-parallel_evidence-1268", "run_id": "2c27d6e83b2046df", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经获取了所有维度的真实证据。让我整理并得出结论。\n\n### 证据汇总\n\n**1. Kubernetes 生命周期与状态 (kubectl_describe, kubectl_get_yaml)**\n*   **Pod 状态**: `phase: Pending`，`ContainersNotReady`。\n*   **容器状态**: `State: Waiting`，`Reason: ImagePullBackOff`，`Restart Count: 0`。\n*   **镜像配置**: `image: registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，`imagePullPolicy: Always`。\n*   **imagePullSecrets**: `<absent>` (YAML 中显示为空)。\n*   **Pod UID**: `91141823-4070-43a3-810c-ddbf5a6b337f` (与 Metrics 一致，确认身份未变)。\n\n**2. 事件 (Events)**\n*   **核心错误**: `Failed to", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789042654075, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "2c27d6e83b2046df-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "2c27d6e83b2046df", "seq": 1269, "ts_ms": 1789042658296, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 41.477, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2c27d6e83b2046df-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "597cc2030a030d3d4fa33d676285e7073e2f8ea3dc635fe79c6caaed630d4181", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "4d70ba27e342f4216bff09b852ca8ea52f858ff59e7039b3b014f98c614b462c"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "2c27d6e83b2046df-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "2c27d6e83b2046df", "seq": 1270, "ts_ms": 1789042658297, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "2c27d6e83b2046df-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "2c27d6e83b2046df", "seq": 1271, "ts_ms": 1789042667856, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.559, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1890, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 registry.invalid，集群DNS无法解析该域名导致镜像拉取失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于待调度完成后的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ImagePullBackOff` (container: app) | 直接定义容器无法进入就绪状态的原因 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Error: ErrImagePull` 及 `Warning Failed ... Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 描述拉取失败的第一层异常状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `failed to resolve reference \"...\": failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/...\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 提供根本原因：DNS 解析失败，集群无法定位 registry.invalid 域名 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `BackOff ... Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 描述集群在多次重试失败后的退避行为 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason: ImagePullBackOff), `kube_pod_status_phase` = 1 (Pending), `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 从指标侧独立印证 Pod 停滞在 Pending 且处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n**证据综合说明：**\nKubernetes 的 State 和 Event 共同锁定异常为镜像拉取阶段，其中 Event 明确指出了 `no such host` 错误，揭示了 DNS 解析失败是拉取操作的直接阻断点。Metric 数据中 `restart_count` 为 0 与 `waiting_reason` 为 `ImagePullBackOff` 进一步确认了容器尚未成功启动过且正在执行拉取逻辑的挂起状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 (registry.invalid) → 集群DNS无法解析该域名 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败 (ErrImagePull) → Pod 状态停滞在 Pending 且容器进入 ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**Pod 配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid`，导致集群 DNS 无法解析该域名，从而引发镜像拉取失败。**\n\n该结论由以下证据直接支撑：\n1. K8s Event 明确指出 `lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`，证实网络/域名层面的不可达性（证据编号 4）。\n2. K8s State 与 Metric 一致确认了 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态及 Pending 阶段，排除了调度或资源竞争等其他常见原因（证据编号 2, 3, 6）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 registry.invalid，集群DNS无法解析该域名导致镜像拉取失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于待调度完成后的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ImagePullBackOff` (container: app) | 直接定义容器无法进入就绪状态的原因 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Error: ErrImagePull` 及 `Warning Failed ... Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 描述拉取失败的第一层异常状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `failed to resolve reference \"...\": failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/...\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 提供根本原因：DNS 解析失败，集群无法定位 registry.invalid 域名 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `BackOff ... Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 描述集群在多次重试失败后的退避行为 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason: ImagePullBackOff), `kube_pod_status_phase` = 1 (Pending), `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 从指标侧独立印证 Pod 停滞在 Pending 且处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n**证据综合说明：**\nKubernetes 的 State 和 Event 共同锁定异常为镜像拉取阶段，其中 Event 明确指出了 `no such host` 错误，揭示了 DNS 解析失败是拉取操作的直接阻断点。Metric 数据中 `restart_count` 为 0 与 `waiting_reason` 为 `ImagePullBackOff` 进一步确认了容器尚未成功启动过且正在执行拉取逻辑的挂起状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 (registry.invalid) → 集群DNS无法解析该域名 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败 (ErrImagePull) → Pod 状态停滞在 Pending 且容器进入 ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**Pod 配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid`，导致集群 DNS 无法解析该域名，从而引发镜像拉取失败。**\n\n该结论由以下证据直接支撑：\n1. K8s Event 明确指出 `lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`，证实网络/域名层面的不可达性（证据编号 4）。\n2. K8s State 与 Metric 一致确认了 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态及 Pending 阶段，排除了调度或资源竞争等其他常见原因（证据编号 2, 3, 6）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

